# Title: Complete English Grammar Booster
# Lang: [en-US]

## Section 1: Spelling & Morphology
- stop + ing | stopping, stoping
  [rule: Spelling_CVC]
  [context: "The car is ... at the red light."]

- bake + ing | baking, bakeing
  [rule: Spelling_Silent_E]
  [context: "I love ... cookies on Sundays."]

- study + ed | studied, studyed
  [rule: Spelling_Y_to_I]

- wife + s | wives, wifes
  [rule: Plural_F_to_V]

## Section 2: Irregular Verbs (The Triple)
- drink (3 forms) | drink - drank - drunk, drink - drunk - drank
  [rule: Verb_Irregular_All]
  [context: "I ... tea, yesterday I ... coffee, and I have ... juice."]

- see (3 forms) | see - saw - seen, see - saw - saw
  [rule: Verb_Irregular_All]
  [context: "I ... you, I ... him, I have ... it all."]

## Section 3: Prepositions & Articles
- У понеділок | on, in, at
  [rule: Prep_Time]
  [context: "See you ... Monday."]

- На стіні | on, in, at
  [rule: Prep_Place]
  [context: "The picture is ... the wall."]

- яблуко | an apple, a apple
  [rule: Article_A_An]
  [context: "I ate ... apple for breakfast."]

## Section 4: Collocations
- робити помилку | make a mistake, do a mistake
  [rule: Collocation_Fixed]
  [context: "Don't be afraid to ... ."]